{{ToonInfo|Toon=Toodles|extra=Eight Ball|Date=June 14, 2024|Pronoun=She|type=Single}}

==Appearance==
Toodles' head is a deep gray, almost black 8-ball with a white spot on her forehead and a light gray number "8" stamped on it. She has black circle-shaped blush underneath her eyes on her cheeks and wears a white, sleeveless dress with a gray hood and two black drawstrings hanging from it. She usually has a playful grin on her face that reveals her teeth. In her Introduction Card artwork, she is seen holding a purple balloon.

==Personality==
Toodles is an energetic and optimistic [[Toon]] who likes to help out and prove herself capable for her age. She doesn't like to admit her weaknesses, such as her fear of the dark, as shown in her interaction with {{CI|Brightney|name=true}} and in one of her dialogues when descending to the next floor. She shows her fear more in her interaction with {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}, where she says she finds elevators scary, or when bringing up {{CI|Goob|name=true}}'s sharp teeth and reacting in evident fear from {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}'s description of dinosaurs. She can also be quite curious, and wants to help and doesn't like it when {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} doesn't allow her to help him in his cases. 

However, she shows a smug side when it comes to Toons like {{CI|Scraps|name=true}} and {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}, as she makes savage remarks about them both, teasing Scraps by saying her tail is better than her dress, and exposing Glisten's constant complaining to her [[Rodger|father figure]]. Sometimes these comments don’t seem to be intentional, and instead come from a place of immaturity and social unawareness.

