==Trivia==
*Toodles and {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}} are both children, and the rest of the [[Toons]] are grown-ups.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1273990141131886695</ref>
**{{CI|Eggson|name=true}} is also an adult, but is elderly, and therefore older than all the others.
**This fact and their Active [[Abilities]] similarities (both boosting a random [[Stat]]) point to her and Gourdy being friends.
***{{CI|Dyle|name=true}} and Gourdy's gossips about Toodles, the [[Changelog|v0.13]] thumbnail (that shows them possibly playing around), and their interaction with each other reinforce their friendship. However, based off of Toodles' Information Card, Toodles is likely younger than Gourdy.
**Because her [[Introduction Card]] calls her "the youngest of [[Dandy's World]]", this technically means Gourdy is older than her, making her the youngest Toon in the entire game.
*Toodles and {{CI|Gigi|name=true}} live on the same floor, as confirmed in their interaction with each other.
*Toodles used to cost 500 {{TI|Ichor|name=true}} before the [[Changelog|v0.2.0]] update.
*Contrary to popular belief, {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} is not Toodles' father, instead looking up to him and his profession, thinking of assisting him/being a detective of her own, as seen in her {{Skin|Junior Detective}} [[Skin]].
*Toodles frequently pet-sits {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}, as shown in {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}'s [[gossip]] about her.
*Toodles' favorite toy is her {{TI|Dog Plush|name=true}}, as seen in her interaction with {{CI|Connie|name=true}}. She is her favorite because she has a spot on her head like she does.
**Toodles' Dog Plush Onesie [[Skin]] could reflect this.
*Toodles and [[Gigi]] used to have the same [[Ability]] sound, due to the same luck motifs. This was changed however, when Gigi got her [[Toon of the Week]] in [[Changelog|v0.28.1]].
**The sound originates from the [[W:C:roblox:Catalog:Banana Peel|Banana Peel]] Gear when stepping on it.
*Toodles' interaction with {{CI|Finn|name=true}} reveals that octopi are her favorite sea creature and overall animal because they have 8 limbs, matching the number on her forehead.
*Toodles is strangely taller than [[Pebble]], {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}, and {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}.
**Cosmo and Shelly are the only humanoid Toons out of them.
*Toodles is the third [[Toon]] to be present in 2 different thumbnails, being in the [[Changelog|v0.11]] and v0.13 thumbnails.
*Toodles is the first [[Toon]] to receive optimizations during an [[Event]], being the [[2025 Halloween Event]].
**She is additionally the first and only Toon to get optimized on a holiday, getting her optimizations on October 31, or Halloween.
**She is also the second Toon to get an optimization in a patch, with the first being {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}.
*Toodles seems to have trouble sleeping at night, instead spying on a [[Toon]]'s late-night activities, even if it is considered private to the Toon, as seen in an interaction with [[Gigi]].
*Coincidentally, the only [[Stickers]] Toodles is featured say "[Item] here!" in their captions, likely relating to her usual eagerness to help.
*Toodles' {{Skin|Dog Plush Onesie}} [[Skin]] was the only one from the [[Changelog|v0.13.14]] update with no relation to the fall season.

